{"4883060":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Nanoquarium","steam_appid":4883060,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"dlc":[4883170],"detailed_description":"<strong>Nanoquarium<\/strong> is a real aquarium that lives on your desktop. Pop the tank out and the fish drift across your screen, swimming over your open windows while your clicks pass straight through to your work, or keep it tucked in a cosy corner, always on top. <strong>All the fun of a fish tank, none of the water changes.<\/strong><br><br><i>Built by someone who bred tropical fish for years, so every fish looks, behaves and breeds like the real animal, not a reskin.<\/i><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4883060\/extras\/b0cb6225447fbbc2784c2bab09dc4254.poster.avif?t=1793659505\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4883060\/extras\/b0cb6225447fbbc2784c2bab09dc4254.webm?t=1793659505\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4883060\/extras\/b0cb6225447fbbc2784c2bab09dc4254.mp4?t=1793659505\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A tank that's always alive<\/h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4883060\/extras\/df15462a38f30560359571ca5021c958.poster.avif?t=1793659505\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4883060\/extras\/df15462a38f30560359571ca5021c958.webm?t=1793659505\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4883060\/extras\/df15462a38f30560359571ca5021c958.mp4?t=1793659505\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><br>It pootles along beside your work whether you're watching or not, so feed it between emails and come back to fry you never saw coming. Tetras shoal, bettas blow bubble nests, corydoras dash up to gulp air, plecos graze the driftwood, shrimp climb the plants. And there's <strong>no way to lose<\/strong>: stocking goes by bioload, not fussy fish-count caps, coins tick along while you're away, and nothing ever dies of neglect. Cosy, never punishing.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Collect 200+ real fish<\/h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4883060\/extras\/9e8102d0ef2fb8494cf48e9850fadf9a.poster.avif?t=1793659505\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4883060\/extras\/9e8102d0ef2fb8494cf48e9850fadf9a.webm?t=1793659505\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4883060\/extras\/9e8102d0ef2fb8494cf48e9850fadf9a.mp4?t=1793659505\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><br>Every fish is based on a real one, with the right shape, size and personality, across three little worlds: a warm <strong>tropical<\/strong> community, a cool <strong>coldwater<\/strong> tank, and a <strong>saltwater reef<\/strong> where coral grows in and clownfish nest in an anemone. <strong>207 species<\/strong> in all, as males and females, long-fin and high-fin strains, pale albinos and inky melanistics, over <strong>500 looks<\/strong> in total, and every fish then gets its own unique markings, so no two are ever quite the same.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Breed your own rare ones<\/h2>Pair two up, watch them court, and raise the next generation, and every kind does it <i>its own way<\/i>: scattering eggs through the plants, tucking them in a cave, blowing a bubble raft, or carrying the babies in its mouth. Colours pass down to the fry and drift a little each time (<strong>RGB colour-blend genetics<\/strong>), so a line slowly becomes your own. Chase a rare fin shape or a colour nobody else has, and one special fish can be worth a small fortune.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Make it your own<\/h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4883060\/extras\/02578247f203539c166f72436aad2a14.poster.avif?t=1793659505\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4883060\/extras\/02578247f203539c166f72436aad2a14.webm?t=1793659505\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4883060\/extras\/02578247f203539c166f72436aad2a14.mp4?t=1793659505\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><br>Plant it, scape it and light it however you like: driftwood and stone, lush carpets, a whole shelf of backgrounds, the water tinted and rippling just so. Save your favourite layouts and switch between them, then grow into a whole <strong>fishroom<\/strong> of up to ten tanks, each with its own look. Just want to play and decorate? <strong>Creative mode<\/strong> hands you everything, unlocked.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >How the desktop overlay works<\/h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4883060\/extras\/e31a8640ce9a2066247e9dae8d1eaee2.poster.avif?t=1793659505\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4883060\/extras\/e31a8640ce9a2066247e9dae8d1eaee2.webm?t=1793659505\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4883060\/extras\/e31a8640ce9a2066247e9dae8d1eaee2.mp4?t=1793659505\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><br>Run the tank any way you like: a frameless window that stays on top in a corner, free-resized to any size, fullscreen, or a <strong>click-through overlay<\/strong> where the fish swim over your apps while your clicks pass straight to your work. Tune exactly what shows, from the whole furnished tank down to just the fish on the bare desktop, or anywhere in between. It's so light and quiet you'll forget it's running, so leave it on all day.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Made by an actual fish breeder<\/h2>Nanoquarium is built by one person who bred tropical fish for years, so the shapes, the sizes, and the way every species behaves and breeds are all drawn from the real thing, not made up. I don't keep tanks any more, and this is the one I get to keep now: all the joy of the hobby with none of the water changes.<br><br><strong>At a glance<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Up to <strong>10 tanks<\/strong> + a <strong>Creative<\/strong> sandbox (all unlocked)<br><\/li><li>Window, fullscreen, a tiny corner, or a click-through <strong>desktop overlay<\/strong> · system-tray icon <i>(overlay + tray are Windows-only; Linux \/ Steam Deck run windowed)<\/i><br><\/li><li>Day\/night &amp; weather, a travelling fish trader, powerheads &amp; bubble gear, a soft generative soundtrack<br><\/li><li>Photo + one-click <strong>GIF<\/strong> capture · full species <strong>bestiary<\/strong> · <strong>59 Steam achievements<\/strong> · <strong>Cloud saves<\/strong><br><\/li><li>Idle economy: <strong>Coins<\/strong> (offline, capped) plus <strong>Breeder Points<\/strong> from breeding milestones<br><\/li><li><strong>Light enough to run on a potato<\/strong> · barely sips power, no graphics card needed<\/li><\/ul>","about_the_game":"<strong>Nanoquarium<\/strong> is a real aquarium that lives on your desktop. Pop the tank out and the fish drift across your screen, swimming over your open windows while your clicks pass straight through to your work, or keep it tucked in a cosy corner, always on top. <strong>All the fun of a fish tank, none of the water changes.<\/strong><br><br><i>Built by someone who bred tropical fish for years, so every fish looks, behaves and breeds like the real animal, not a reskin.<\/i><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4883060\/extras\/b0cb6225447fbbc2784c2bab09dc4254.poster.avif?t=1793659505\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4883060\/extras\/b0cb6225447fbbc2784c2bab09dc4254.webm?t=1793659505\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4883060\/extras\/b0cb6225447fbbc2784c2bab09dc4254.mp4?t=1793659505\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A tank that's always alive<\/h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4883060\/extras\/df15462a38f30560359571ca5021c958.poster.avif?t=1793659505\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4883060\/extras\/df15462a38f30560359571ca5021c958.webm?t=1793659505\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4883060\/extras\/df15462a38f30560359571ca5021c958.mp4?t=1793659505\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><br>It pootles along beside your work whether you're watching or not, so feed it between emails and come back to fry you never saw coming. Tetras shoal, bettas blow bubble nests, corydoras dash up to gulp air, plecos graze the driftwood, shrimp climb the plants. And there's <strong>no way to lose<\/strong>: stocking goes by bioload, not fussy fish-count caps, coins tick along while you're away, and nothing ever dies of neglect. Cosy, never punishing.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Collect 200+ real fish<\/h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4883060\/extras\/9e8102d0ef2fb8494cf48e9850fadf9a.poster.avif?t=1793659505\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4883060\/extras\/9e8102d0ef2fb8494cf48e9850fadf9a.webm?t=1793659505\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4883060\/extras\/9e8102d0ef2fb8494cf48e9850fadf9a.mp4?t=1793659505\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><br>Every fish is based on a real one, with the right shape, size and personality, across three little worlds: a warm <strong>tropical<\/strong> community, a cool <strong>coldwater<\/strong> tank, and a <strong>saltwater reef<\/strong> where coral grows in and clownfish nest in an anemone. <strong>207 species<\/strong> in all, as males and females, long-fin and high-fin strains, pale albinos and inky melanistics, over <strong>500 looks<\/strong> in total, and every fish then gets its own unique markings, so no two are ever quite the same.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Breed your own rare ones<\/h2>Pair two up, watch them court, and raise the next generation, and every kind does it <i>its own way<\/i>: scattering eggs through the plants, tucking them in a cave, blowing a bubble raft, or carrying the babies in its mouth. Colours pass down to the fry and drift a little each time (<strong>RGB colour-blend genetics<\/strong>), so a line slowly becomes your own. Chase a rare fin shape or a colour nobody else has, and one special fish can be worth a small fortune.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Make it your own<\/h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4883060\/extras\/02578247f203539c166f72436aad2a14.poster.avif?t=1793659505\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4883060\/extras\/02578247f203539c166f72436aad2a14.webm?t=1793659505\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4883060\/extras\/02578247f203539c166f72436aad2a14.mp4?t=1793659505\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><br>Plant it, scape it and light it however you like: driftwood and stone, lush carpets, a whole shelf of backgrounds, the water tinted and rippling just so. Save your favourite layouts and switch between them, then grow into a whole <strong>fishroom<\/strong> of up to ten tanks, each with its own look. Just want to play and decorate? <strong>Creative mode<\/strong> hands you everything, unlocked.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >How the desktop overlay works<\/h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4883060\/extras\/e31a8640ce9a2066247e9dae8d1eaee2.poster.avif?t=1793659505\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4883060\/extras\/e31a8640ce9a2066247e9dae8d1eaee2.webm?t=1793659505\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4883060\/extras\/e31a8640ce9a2066247e9dae8d1eaee2.mp4?t=1793659505\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><br>Run the tank any way you like: a frameless window that stays on top in a corner, free-resized to any size, fullscreen, or a <strong>click-through overlay<\/strong> where the fish swim over your apps while your clicks pass straight to your work. Tune exactly what shows, from the whole furnished tank down to just the fish on the bare desktop, or anywhere in between. It's so light and quiet you'll forget it's running, so leave it on all day.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Made by an actual fish breeder<\/h2>Nanoquarium is built by one person who bred tropical fish for years, so the shapes, the sizes, and the way every species behaves and breeds are all drawn from the real thing, not made up. I don't keep tanks any more, and this is the one I get to keep now: all the joy of the hobby with none of the water changes.<br><br><strong>At a glance<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Up to <strong>10 tanks<\/strong> + a <strong>Creative<\/strong> sandbox (all unlocked)<br><\/li><li>Window, fullscreen, a tiny corner, or a click-through <strong>desktop overlay<\/strong> · system-tray icon <i>(overlay + tray are Windows-only; Linux \/ Steam Deck run windowed)<\/i><br><\/li><li>Day\/night &amp; weather, a travelling fish trader, powerheads &amp; bubble gear, a soft generative soundtrack<br><\/li><li>Photo + one-click <strong>GIF<\/strong> capture · full species <strong>bestiary<\/strong> · <strong>59 Steam achievements<\/strong> · <strong>Cloud saves<\/strong><br><\/li><li>Idle economy: <strong>Coins<\/strong> (offline, capped) plus <strong>Breeder Points<\/strong> from breeding milestones<br><\/li><li><strong>Light enough to run on a potato<\/strong> · barely sips power, no graphics card needed<\/li><\/ul>","short_description":"A whisper-quiet aquarium that lives in the corner of your screen. Collect 200+ real-world fish across tropical, coldwater and reef tanks, breed them for rare strains, run a whole fishroom, and let the tank tick over while you work. No pressure, no fail state — just your fish, drifting.","supported_languages":"English, French, Italian, German, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Spanish - Latin America, Japanese, Korean, Simplified Chinese","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4883060\/95a5206df8369ba955110d4d8c2c209d79b42b07\/header.jpg?t=1793659505","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4883060\/a3a40319b4685c84366eb6a30d9ac5efa9ee329f\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1793659505","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4883060\/a3a40319b4685c84366eb6a30d9ac5efa9ee329f\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1793659505","website":null,"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br><\/li><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 11 (64-bit)<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> x64 CPU with AVX2 — Intel 4th-gen Core (Haswell, 2013) or AMD Ryzen (Zen, 2017) or newer<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 150 MB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> Any — software-rendered, no GPU required<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 50 MB available space<br><\/li><li><strong>Sound Card:<\/strong> Any<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br><\/li><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 11 (64-bit)<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Any recent multi-core x64 CPU<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 300 MB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> Any — software-rendered, no GPU required<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 50 MB available space<br><\/li><li><strong>Sound Card:<\/strong> Any<\/li><\/ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><\/ul>"},"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> A modern 64-bit glibc Linux — SteamOS 3+ \/ Ubuntu 22.04+ (or equivalent)<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> x64 CPU with AVX2 — Intel 4th-gen Core (Haswell, 2013) or AMD Ryzen (Zen, 2017) or newer<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 150 MB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> Any — software-rendered, no GPU required<br